cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the Fable Computer models or build on the design, please cite the
  manuscript(s) below and describe what you changed.
title: "The Fable Computer: models and manuscripts"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Furui
    given-names: Ryoji
    email: github@ryoji.info
    website: https://www.ryoji.info
    affiliation: Nano Fusion Design
repository-code: https://github.com/ryoji-info/FableComputer
license: Apache-2.0
preferred-citation:
  type: report
  title: >-
    The Fable Computer: A Room-Temperature Terahertz Half Adder on a
    Regenerative Graphene-Plasmon Logic Fabric — Concept, Architecture, and
    Reduced-Order Feasibility
  authors:
    - family-names: Furui
      given-names: Ryoji
  year: 2026
  month: 10
  version: v6.1
  doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23758795
  url: https://github.com/ryoji-info/FableComputer/blob/main/papers/Fable-Computer-Part-I.pdf
  notes: >-
    Not peer-reviewed; claims are in-model (reduced-order chain, reproducible
    from this repository). The manuscripts are living documents: the community's
    promoted notes (notes/) are folded back into them in periodic community
    revisions, each archived on Zenodo under its own version DOI. The DOI above is the
    v6.1 deposit of 29 October 2026, the citable version, and the copy in this
    repository is that deposited v6.1. Earlier
    version DOIs continue to resolve to the manuscripts as they stood. The
    manuscripts carry no in-document version statements; versions, deposit DOIs and
    the full revision history live in papers/REVISION-HISTORY.md, and
    papers/ERRATA.md reports any adopted correction not yet in the current deposit
    (none outstanding since the October 2026 deposits). For the quantum extension
    cite Part II, and for the ternary-model embedding Part III (see references).
references:
  - type: report
    title: >-
      The Fable Computer, Part II: Quantum-Limited Analog Tensor Processing
      on the Regenerative Graphene-Plasmon Fabric
    authors:
      - family-names: Furui
        given-names: Ryoji
    year: 2026
    month: 10
    version: v2.1
    doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23758729
    url: https://github.com/ryoji-info/FableComputer/blob/main/papers/Fable-Computer-Part-II.pdf
    notes: >-
      The DOI above is the v2.1 deposit of 29 October 2026, the citable version,
      and the copy in this repository is that deposited v2.1.
  - type: report
    title: >-
      The Fable Computer, Part III: A Ternary Language Model on the
      Regenerative Graphene-Plasmon Fabric
    authors:
      - family-names: Furui
        given-names: Ryoji
    year: 2026
    month: 10
    version: v1.1
    doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23758679
    url: https://github.com/ryoji-info/FableComputer/blob/main/papers/Fable-Computer-Part-III.pdf
    notes: >-
      The DOI above is the v1.1 deposit of 29 October 2026, the citable version;
      every number it computes reproduces from fable-model-ternary/ in this
      repository.
